DESCRIPTION:I worked full-time on a Python FOSS project for 503 days\, so w
 hat did I learn?\n\nIn this talk I will share some of the lessons I learne
 d over the course of these 503 days:\n\n - how to get a tech job in this d
 ay & age\n - how to put your ego aside when working with others (who know 
 more than you!) and how to deal with mistakes\n - how to interact with use
 rs & contributors online\n - how it feels to collaborate to a large code b
 ase
